OL,3,GNEWSABreast cancer is rare in young
OL,4,Awomen ` but I had it
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreast cancer is the most common form
OL,7,Fof cancer in the UK but is rare in
OL,8,Fyounger women.
OL,10,FWomen in their 20s accounted for only
OL,11,F250 (0.5%) of the 50,535 cases in
OL,12,FEngland in 2023, and only three women
OL,13,Faged 19 or under were diagnosed that
OL,14,Fyear, according to the National Disease
OL,15,FRegistration Service.
OL,17,FBut charities and survivors insist it
OL,18,Fis "crucial" to keep checking yourself.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
