OL,3,GNEWSABreast cancer is rare in young
OL,4,Awomen ` but I had it
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS data examined recently by the BBC's
OL,7,FPanorama showed the number of younger
OL,8,Fadults getting cancer, including breast
OL,9,Fcancer, is rising.
